   Carobbi, Carlo F. M., Univ Florence, Dept Informat Engn, I-50139 Florence, Italy.
   Izzo, Danilo, Valeo Schalter \& Sensoren GmbH, D-74321 Bietigheim Bissingen, Germany.},
