   Grundstrom, Casandra; Korhonen, Olli; Vayrynen, Karin; Isomursu, Minna, Univ Oulu, Fac Informat Technol \& Elect Engn, Pentti Kaiteran Katu 1,POB 4500, FI-90014 Oulu, Finland.},
DOI = {10.2196/16102},
