Year = {1992},
Volume = {603},
Pages = {80-91},
Abstract = {This paper presents the results of a metric-based investigation into the
   nature and benefits of reuse in an Ada development environment. Four
   medium scale Ada projects developed in one organization over a three
   year period were analyzed. The study indicates benefits of reuse in
   terms of reduced error density and increased productivity. The Ada
   generic features are observed as an enabler of reuse at higher levels of
   abstraction. Finally, using several metrics, we identify trends
   indicating an improving reuse process.},
