Abstract = {VHD is a morbid condition in which AI has the po-tential to improve
   screening, diagnosis, pheno-mapping, and risk prediction. Currently,
   most of the research and applications remain relatively early in the
   development and implementation life-cycle. Future research should
   prioritize adherence to reporting guidelines, sharing code and datasets
   when able, external validation in diverse popula-tions, measuring and
   reducing bias in algorithms, prospective evaluation in clinical trials,
